1
00:00:02,766 --> 00:00:04,213
My name is Peppa

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,981
And this is my little brother George

3
00:00:07,557 --> 00:00:09,226
This is Mummy Pig

4
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,406
This is Daddy Pig

5
00:00:13,576 --> 00:00:14,836
I'm Peppa

6
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:20,656
[George's Friend]

7
00:00:21,316 --> 00:00:24,027
Peppa and her friends are playing at the playground

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,892
Peppa, Suzy and Danny

9
00:00:26,932 --> 00:00:28,172
are playing on the roundabout

10
00:00:28,213 --> 00:00:29,275
Are you ready?

11
00:00:29,316 --> 00:00:30,382
-Ready!
-Ready!

12
00:00:30,423 --> 00:00:32,395
Okay, here we go

13
00:00:33,024 --> 00:00:34,530
-Whee!
-Whee!

14
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:36,465
Faster, faster!

15
00:00:36,505 --> 00:00:37,724
All right then

16
00:00:37,844 --> 00:00:39,799
-Whee!
-Whee!

17
00:00:42,872 --> 00:00:45,308
George is too little to play on the roundabout

18
00:00:45,348 --> 00:00:46,847
He's on the swings instead

19
00:00:50,389 --> 00:00:51,734
Rebecca's here

20
00:00:51,796 --> 00:00:53,876
And she's brought her little brother Richard too

21
00:00:54,871 --> 00:00:56,325
Hi, everyone!

22
00:00:58,076 --> 00:00:59,583
-Hi!
-Hi!

23
00:01:00,089 --> 00:01:02,329
Can I play on the roundabout too?

24
00:01:02,369 --> 00:01:04,049
Hop on, Rebecca

25
00:01:04,889 --> 00:01:07,450
This time we're going to spin really, really fast

26
00:01:08,890 --> 00:01:11,585
Richard wants to hop on the roundabout too

27
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,219
If Richard gets on as well

28
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:16,927
then we won't be able to spin so fast

29
00:01:17,144 --> 00:01:19,303
Richard can play with George instead

30
00:01:19,556 --> 00:01:20,496
Richard

31
00:01:20,670 --> 00:01:22,591
Do you want to go and play with George?

32
00:01:22,711 --> 00:01:23,605
No

33
00:01:23,945 --> 00:01:25,291
George has a dinosaur

34
00:01:25,331 --> 00:01:26,835
Just like yours!

35
00:01:26,876 --> 00:01:28,156
Let's go and see

36
00:01:29,556 --> 00:01:31,869
George and Richard are about the same age

37
00:01:31,909 --> 00:01:34,466
Richard wants to see George's dinosaur

38
00:01:35,672 --> 00:01:36,947
Dinosaur!

39
00:01:38,475 --> 00:01:39,349
George

40
00:01:39,415 --> 00:01:41,878
Can you lend your dinosaur to Richard to play with?

41
00:01:41,918 --> 00:01:42,979
No way

42
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:43,955
Richard

43
00:01:43,996 --> 00:01:46,362
Can you lend your dinosaur to George to play with?

44
00:01:46,402 --> 00:01:47,280
No way

45
00:01:47,654 --> 00:01:50,974
George and Richard don't want to share their dinosaurs

46
00:01:51,446 --> 00:01:52,443
George

47
00:01:52,483 --> 00:01:55,770
It's much more fun when you share your toys

48
00:01:56,642 --> 00:01:59,222
George is such a good little boy

49
00:02:00,085 --> 00:02:01,655
Dinosaur!

50
00:02:03,985 --> 00:02:05,772
George doesn't like sharing

51
00:02:05,813 --> 00:02:06,665
Richard

52
00:02:06,872 --> 00:02:09,558
Now it's your turn to let George hold the dinosaur

53
00:02:12,024 --> 00:02:14,291
Richard doesn't like sharing either

54
00:02:15,844 --> 00:02:18,068
Why are you two crying so loudly?

55
00:02:18,108 --> 00:02:20,270
Every time George and Richard play together

56
00:02:20,311 --> 00:02:21,987
they end up crying

57
00:02:22,027 --> 00:02:25,325
They're too little, they don't know how to play with others yet

58
00:02:25,366 --> 00:02:26,253
As the big sister

59
00:02:26,293 --> 00:02:28,139
why don't you teach them how to play together?

60
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:29,152
No problem

61
00:02:29,192 --> 00:02:31,798
We could teach them to build sandcastles

62
00:02:31,865 --> 00:02:32,904
Good idea

63
00:02:32,944 --> 00:02:34,393
Let's go to the sandpit

64
00:02:38,949 --> 00:02:41,182
George and Richard love playing in the sand

65
00:02:41,649 --> 00:02:43,730
George, Richard

66
00:02:43,863 --> 00:02:47,465
Let's all build a sandcastle together today

67
00:02:47,731 --> 00:02:50,501
First, fill the bucket with sand

68
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,515
Then you turn the bucket upside down

69
00:02:55,555 --> 00:02:57,796
And gently pat it down

70
00:02:59,958 --> 00:03:02,196
Now we lift up the bucket

71
00:03:02,556 --> 00:03:04,160
It worked!

72
00:03:04,333 --> 00:03:06,077
Richard made a sandcastle

73
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:07,745
It worked!

74
00:03:07,878 --> 00:03:10,062
And George made a sandcastle too!

75
00:03:13,145 --> 00:03:16,578
See, playing together is fun

76
00:03:24,546 --> 00:03:25,516
Oh no

77
00:03:25,556 --> 00:03:27,676
This isn't going well

78
00:03:27,716 --> 00:03:29,915
It's your little brother's fault

79
00:03:30,241 --> 00:03:33,368
He just wrecked George's sandcastle

80
00:03:33,795 --> 00:03:37,670
Your little brother wrecked my little brother's sandcastle first

81
00:03:38,223 --> 00:03:39,396
Hey, hey

82
00:03:39,436 --> 00:03:40,637
You two, as the big sisters

83
00:03:40,677 --> 00:03:42,018
