85
00:03:44,279 --> 00:03:46,561
That's right, we're the big sisters

86
00:03:46,601 --> 00:03:48,441
And George and Richard are too little

87
00:03:48,482 --> 00:03:50,895
to know how to play nicely with others

88
00:03:51,674 --> 00:03:53,325
I have a good idea

89
00:03:53,385 --> 00:03:54,213
George

90
00:03:54,254 --> 00:03:57,386
What's your favorite thing to play at the playground?

91
00:03:58,289 --> 00:03:59,489
The seesaw

92
00:03:59,683 --> 00:04:01,717
George's favorite is the seesaw

93
00:04:05,501 --> 00:04:07,181
Seesaw

94
00:04:08,014 --> 00:04:10,662
Turns out it's hard to play seesaw alone

95
00:04:14,136 --> 00:04:16,085
Richard wants to play seesaw too

96
00:04:17,135 --> 00:04:18,734
Seesaw

97
00:04:18,775 --> 00:04:20,100
Seesaw

98
00:04:20,141 --> 00:04:21,634
Seesaw

99
00:04:21,675 --> 00:04:22,491
Look

100
00:04:22,532 --> 00:04:25,110
George and Richard are finally playing together

101
00:04:25,151 --> 00:04:26,546
Seesaw

102
00:04:26,666 --> 00:04:27,976
Seesaw

103
00:04:28,017 --> 00:04:29,285
Seesaw

104
00:04:29,326 --> 00:04:30,636
Seesaw

105
00:04:31,674 --> 00:04:33,300
George likes Richard

106
00:04:34,772 --> 00:04:36,536
And Richard really likes George too!

107
00:04:36,933 --> 00:04:39,276
George and Richard both love playing together

108
